Step A: Port scanning & Service fingerprinting (**Nmap**) -> Manual PT
kali$ nmap -sS -sV -O 10.0.2.5 
->vsFTPd 3.0.3 may have anonymous access enabled
->openSSH 7.4p1 Debian could be brute forced or banner exploited
